===========================
OBJECTIVE
===========================

The system should execute an entire API test case automatically.

Given a single test definition, the platform must

• execute APIs
• capture request/response
• capture before/after MongoDB state
• compare objects
• generate differences
• create human-readable observations
• generate evidence
• publish results to Confluence

The tester should never manually open Postman or MongoDB.

Everything should be automatic.

